E AX3053 1202-unhandled-closures.ax:77:6-10 unhandled-operation "`main` reaches operation `field` of effect `Field` with no handler: the process would write `axiom: unhandled effect` and exit 71 there - main -> usesField" #"reaches `Field` with nothing handling it" ^69:6-15:"`usesField` performs it" ?"install one - `(handle BODY (E) HANDLER)` around the call - or, if an unhandled operation of this effect is a deliberate abort as `Assert`'s is, write `;@axiom:unhandled(trap)` above its `effect` declaration"
